  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 10.22,
      "end": 22.89,
      "text": "Today is day one. Today is day one of the off week. This is the first week. I have taken off in just over a year"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.35,
      "end": 26.55,
      "text": "And so I'm bored out of my mind. I'm bored as fuck"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.47,
      "end": 30.21,
      "text": "So today we're gonna be reviewing some ride footage from the weekend"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.19,
      "end": 35.67,
      "text": "Basically, there's this segment on Holcombe the dip. It's called the dip underneath Holcombe"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.21,
      "end": 40.75,
      "text": "Basically, there's this segment on Holcombe. It's called the dip underneath Holcombe"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.03,
      "end": 47.93,
      "text": "Diego has wanted this KOM for ever. He's really wanted this KOM for the past, I would say since"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.93,
      "end": 53.19,
      "text": "the beginning of the semester, but he has not gotten it. We've attacked it like maybe five or six times."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.75,
      "end": 59.35,
      "text": "Basically every ride he's come out and done. And this is what happened on the ride on Sunday."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.17,
      "end": 66.41,
      "text": "And this is what happened on the ride on Saturday. You can see here it kind of starts on the front"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.41,
      "end": 67.63,
      "text": "and then BANG!"
    }
  ],
